        <p source="#source-49981-50091"><seg n="2" type="heading" rend="dogyo" source="#source-49981-50041"><seg source="#source-49981-49993">五月七日</seg></seg><seg source="#source-50041-50091">　ワフタンゴフ劇場〔入場券貼付〕</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-50091-50200" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p source="#source-50112-50200">「ア<g ref="#gaiji-1-7-82" source="#source-50118-50163">ヷ</g>ンガリド」〔「前衛」〕</p>
